{"c":[{"id":"667b5bd40e9be23ddeec380c5631a3fc8f731cf58d56db154c12dedfa451142e","sum":"Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem); help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP sunset; living docs are README, docs/, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T023238Z-bbf825b6f524dcb6","text":"Nap Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem), same as the baked prompt; usage_text keeps CLI_NAME (summem).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T025054Z-8222dbc737ce85a4","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are being sunset: leftovers go under docs/; README and memory-bank become the living docs; VISION is no longer the design contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"5e022ef533bec84293259aa4a3c815b8633f4e3e47847b355f86fca71dea8117","sum":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md retired. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (the atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank. VISION is not the contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T025220Z-1a52749b783612ee","text":"docs-sunset plan: VISION/ROADMAP retire; architecture lives at docs/architecture/; leftovers (sqlite, hooks, cover(T), pack-size, hot margin) at docs/notes.md; README is the public face.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T030457Z-f1b0d73acb7f8b59","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are gone. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/, docs/notes.md, and the memory-bank. The architecture page is the atlas; VISION is not the contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
